Vikram and Betal: The Patient Farmer (Raw Story)

id: WBX_100126

King Vikram was carrying Betal through the forest once again.

Betal began his story.

“Once there was a farmer who worked very hard on his land,” said Betal. “But his crops did not grow well.”

Many people told him to give up.

But the farmer did not lose hope.

He continued to water his fields and take care of them every day.

After some time, his crops finally grew strong and healthy.

He had a great harvest.

The villagers were surprised and asked, “How did you succeed?”

The farmer smiled and said, “I had patience and did not give up.”

Betal then asked, “Vikram, what helped the farmer succeed?”

Vikram replied, “His patience and hard work brought him success.”

As soon as Vikram spoke, Betal flew back to the tree.

💖 Moral:

Patience and hard work lead to success.
